 'MAIN reference is the REAR-left photograph of the brown/grey Ford Focus Mk3 facelift FIVE-DOOR HATCHBACK exhibited at Kragujevac in 2016. Preserve this rear-left camera and the short hatch body, compact rear overhang, wraparound horizontal rear lamps, roof spoiler, rear wiper, chrome window edging and the exact source silver five-spoke alloy wheels. Front side window is open; retain it. Remove the foreground information stand, people, other cars, exhibition scene, plate text and bright hall reflections. SECOND reference is the FRONT view of the same brown show car: use it only as supporting evidence for its complete thin roof antenna and identity, NOT to change the rear camera. Do not turn this into a sedan or station wagon. Keep full antenna tip in the roomy frame and normal opaque bodywork.'
